  "details": "Problem: Sometimes black orbs appeared in preview screen when the DoF simulation is enabled.\nPossible reason:\nSometimes a scene contains NaN pixels. (e.g., surface of water in https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_1fd302d5-53a6-4405-8d1f-208419575236 )\nNaNs will be replaced to zero by applying post processing typically.\nIn the current implementation, the DoF simulation for previews runs before post processing and it spreads NaNs.",
